dParaRPr lang="en-GB"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="Text Placeholder 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{975D981F-4EAF-7805-B9C7-0ABB2D25850F}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="subTitle" sz="quarter" idx="11"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB"/><a:t>Frontier Accelerate for Copilot</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Text Placeholder 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{B81C012B-0FCF-FDD2-8825-EE230C69ADE2}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="quarter" idx="12"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="576072" y="1796298"/><a:ext cx="2993038" cy="4704667"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr vert="horz" wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:noAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1600" dirty="0"/><a:t>New Frontier Accelerate </a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1600" dirty="0"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1600" dirty="0"/><a:t>pre-sales engagement for FY27!</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>FY27 reframes pre-sales envisioning around Frontier Transformation by moving beyond AI features and toward end-to-end workflow reinvention. Conversations now center on agents, intelligence (Microsoft IQ), and quantifiable business outcomes.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>This year’s engagement model keeps the flexible engagement structure from FY26. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>Power Platform is no longer in scope. This engagement is now exclusively focused on driving pre-sales activities that </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="+mj-lt"/></a:rPr><a:t>build intent and drive revenue/usage for Microsoft 365 Copilot, agents and Microsoft Agent 365.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="+mj-lt"/></a:rPr><a:t>FY27 MCI eligibility includes SME&amp;C expansion. Please review the </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="50000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:hlinkClick r:id="rId4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{A12FA001-AC4F-418D-AE19-62706E023703}"><ahyp:hlinkClr xmlns:ahyp="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2018/hyperlinkcolor" val="tx"/></a:ext></a:extLst></a:hlinkClick></a:rPr><a:t>MCI Incentives Guide</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="+mj-lt"/></a:rPr><a:t> for this year’s partner and customer eligibility criteria. </a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="8" name="Text Placeholder 7"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{70D1497C-40BF-E596-2E8D-898A17492EEF}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="quarter" idx="13"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="3989453" y="1796298"/><a:ext cx="5919020" cy="4093728"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr vert="horz" wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:noAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1600" dirty="0"/><a:t>Updated assets and resources</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t>We have included assets and resources to help you drive AI in the daily flow of work for every employee and increase adoption of high-impact scenarios that transform end-to-end workflows. Please review all assets as many have changed from FY26.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/><a:t> Key changes include:</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>New Copilot Cowork Engagement Delivery Guidance</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>New Agent 365 PoC Kit</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>Reframed around Frontier Transformation – from Copilot and agents to end-to-end workflow reinvention and customer transformation with measurable ROI </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>Updated Product Pitch Decks for M365 Copilot, Copilot Studio, A365, and more</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>Updated “Turn AI potential into high-impact business cases and ROI”</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>New Work IQ Overview</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>New Copilot Cowork Launch Kit and Task Packs</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>New Cowork Cost Estimator</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>New Prompt Packs</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>Increased depth in security and governance with updated Agent 365 materials</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>New and updated adoption resources</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" b="1" dirty="0"/><a:t>New PRC Agent. </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>Meet the Partner Resource Catalog (PRC) Agent: dynamically surface and download ready-to-use IP for your Copilot and agent-centric engagements. Try it at </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="50000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:hlinkClick r:id="rId5"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{A12FA001-AC4F-418D-AE19-62706E023703}"><ahyp:hlinkClr xmlns:ahyp="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2018/hyperlinkcolor" val="tx"/></a:ext></a:extLst></a:hlinkClick></a:rPr><a:t>https://aka.ms/PRCAgent</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/><a:t>. </a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="11" name="TextBox 10"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{17E9B8F6-142F-5A26-D625-CC7DC5AEF9B5}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="576072" y="1322464"/><a:ext cx="8587740" cy="369332"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" marR="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="l" defTabSz="914367" rtl="0" eaLnBrk="1" fontAlgn="auto" latinLnBrk="0" hangingPunct="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClrTx/><a:buSzTx/><a:buFontTx/><a:buNone/><a:tabLst/><a:defRPr/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr kumimoji="0" lang="en-GB" sz="1800" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" kern="1200" cap="none" spc="0" normalizeH="0" baseline="0" noProof="0" dirty="0"><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:sch